229
00:16:45.708 --> 00:16:46.708
5'1.

230
00:16:47.958 --> 00:16:48.958
He's 5'1.

231
00:16:52.167 --> 00:16:54.125
Yeah, okay, just
write down this one.

232
00:16:54.375 --> 00:16:55.667
Yeah, it's 5'1.

233
00:16:57.708 --> 00:16:58.708
