Yeah.

1316
01:26:30.667 --> 01:26:31.667
Brother!

1317
01:26:33.042 --> 01:26:34.082
Let's go through the back.

1318
01:26:35.125 --> 01:26:36.167
Yeah, why not?

1319
01:26:38.625 --> 01:26:40.167
I'll clean up and come.
You stay here.

1320
01:26:52.417 --> 01:26:54.000
- Who is it?
- Personal.

1321
01:27:07.125 --> 01:27:09.167
Jaggi!

1322
01:27:15.000 --> 01:27:16.018
PRIVATE NUMBER: WHERE ARE YOU?

1323
01:27:16.042 --> 01:27:17.059
