1324
01:27:17.083 --> 01:27:18.476
WE DON'T HAVE THE TIME, JAGGI.
DID YOU REACH THE HOTEL?

1325
01:27:18.500 --> 01:27:19.625
DID YOU FIND SUMAIR?

1326
01:27:54.917 --> 01:27:56.375
