1327
01:28:02.542 --> 01:28:03.542
Yeah?

1328
01:28:08.458 --> 01:28:09.458
I'll be back.

1329
01:28:11.250 --> 01:28:12.250
Rafa.

1330
01:28:21.333 --> 01:28:22.833
Just stay here and give me your gun.

1331
01:28:23.833 --> 01:28:25.375
- Bhaisaab?
- Just stay here!

1332
01:28:25.792 --> 01:28:27.917
Give me the gun. I'll be back.

1333
01:28:36.750 --> 01:28:37.750
Give me the gun.

1334
01:28:38.708 --> 01:28:39.708
Give me the gun.

1335
01:28:45.542 --> 01:28:46.542
Come on.

1336
01:28:49.000 --> 01:28:51.167
