1337
01:29:04.083 --> 01:29:05.292
Where's my son, Sikandar?

1338
01:29:05.667 --> 01:29:07.417
- I'll shoot him!
- Go on! Shoot!

1339
01:29:07.500 --> 01:29:08.667
