- Shut up!

1346
01:29:19.333 --> 01:29:21.309
Shut up! You've been
chewing my ear off all evening!

1347
01:29:21.333 --> 01:29:23.042
- Shut up!
- I've made you what you are!

1348
01:29:23.125 --> 01:29:26.458
He was a small-time dope peddler
