1357
01:29:42.625 --> 01:29:44.875
- That was my idea as well!
- Shut the f*** up!

1358
01:29:44.958 --> 01:29:46.042
Hey, I'll shoot you!

1359
01:30:04.875 --> 01:30:06.000
Flour? Really?

1360
01:30:06.167 --> 01:30:07.167
Where's my son?

1361
01:30:16.125 --> 01:30:17.125
Shit!

1362
01:30:20.125 --> 01:30:21.125
Jaggi!

1363
01:30:21.792 --> 01:30:22.792
Jaggi!

1364
01:30:27.042 --> 01:30:28.792
Look, I don't have the time for this.

1365
01:30:30.250 --> 01:30:33.083
Tell me where the bag is,
or I swear on my kids' lives

1366
01:30:33.167 --> 01:30:34.292
I'll kill your son.

1367
01:30:35.750 --> 01:30:36.750
Check the car.

1368
01:30:44.667 --> 01:30:45.947
